  "releaseNotes": "[Add] PsmApiClient implements the 35 operations of the Systems Modeling API and Services REST/HTTP PSM, generated from its OpenAPI description (#404)\n          [Add] PsmApiException and MergeConflictException report failed requests and merge conflicts returned by the service (#404)\n          [Update] ISession opens against a base address, exposes the IPsmApiClient and returns the available projects; username and password login is removed (#404)\n          [Remove] RestClient, IRestClient and AuthenticationStatusKind, superseded by PsmApiClient (#404)",
